plicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MIYOSHI SEIJI</name> <address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKEUCHI YASUAKI</name> <address><country>JP</country> </address> </addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKEYABU MASATO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOSHIMI MASAHISA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJITSU LIMITED</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI, YUJI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYOSHI, SEIJI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKEUCHI, YASUAKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKEYABU, MASATO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIMI, MASAHISA</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI YUJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MIYOSHI SEIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKEUCHI YASUAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKEYABU MASATO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOSHIMI MASAHISA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI, YUJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYOSHI, SEIJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKEUCHI, YASUAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKEYABU, MASATO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIMI, MASAHISA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Power-supply voltage is controlled according to the amplitude of a signal output from a transmission line driver circuit when the power-supply voltage is applied from a power supply circuit to the transmission line driver circuit that sends signals to the transmission line.  For instance, the maximum value of a signal input to the transmission line driver circuit during one of equally sectioned periods is detected, a target value for the power-supply voltage to be applied to the transmission line driver circuit is determined according to the maximum value, and the power supply circuit is controlled so that the target voltage value and the actual power-supply voltage value coincide.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une tension de réseau commandée en fonction de l'amplitude d'une sortie de signal provenant d'un circuit d'entraînement de ligne de transmission lorsque ladite tension est appliquée à un circuit d'entraînement de ligne de transmission à partir d'un circuit d'alimentation qui envoie des signaux à ladite ligne de transmission. Par exemple, durant une des périodes d'égales sections, la valeur maximale d'une entrée de signal vers un circuit d'entraînement de ligne de transmission est détectée, une valeur cible pour la tension de réseau à appliquer au circuit d'entraînement de ligne de transmission est déterminée en fonction de la valeur maximale et le circuit d'alimentation est commandé de façon à faire coïncider la valeur de tension cible et la valeur réelle de la tension de réseau.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>